{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 📘 阶段 1 · 补 1: DPO 家族演化脉络\n",
    "\n",
    "对应你那张「DPO 变体全景图」, 用代码把 **6 个改进动机** 串起来, 每个改进对应一行代码就能看到效果。\n",
    "\n",
    "图中的演化路径 (从基础 DPO 出发):\n",
    "```\n",
    "                       ┌─── IPO (平方损失)\n",
    "                       │\n",
    "                       ├─── CPO (+ SFT NLL)\n",
    "                       │\n",
    "                       ├─── KTO (非成对数据)\n",
    "         DPO ──────────┼─── ORPO (无 ref + odds ratio)\n",
    "                       │\n",
    "                       ├─── SimPO (length-norm + 无 ref)\n",
    "                       │\n",
    "                       └─── SIPO (统计信息修正)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**核心问题**: DPO 有什么缺点? 为什么大家要造这么多变体?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('../common'))\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import torch.nn.functional as F\n",
    "from dpo_losses import dpo_loss, ipo_loss, cpo_loss, kto_loss, orpo_loss, simpo_loss, sipo_loss\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(0)\n",
    "print('Imports ok.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.1 改进 1: DPO 容易过拟合 → IPO (平方损失)\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**: DPO 用 sigmoid 损失, 当模型对 chosen 的概率远高于 ref 时, 梯度很小 (饱和)。\n",
    "**改进**: IPO 换成平方损失, 强制 `h_pi - h_ref` 回归到 `1/(2β)`, 永远有梯度, 不会过拟合。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟: chosen 比 ref 高很多 (DPO 会饱和), 看看两个 loss 的梯度\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "x = torch.linspace(-5, 5, 100)  # logit 范围\n",
    "beta = 0.1\n",
    "\n",
    "dpo_grad = []\n",
    "ipo_grad = []\n",
    "for v in x:\n",
    "    v = torch.tensor(v, requires_grad=True)\n",
    "    l = -F.logsigmoid(beta * v)\n",
    "    g = torch.autograd.grad(l, v)[0].item()\n",
    "    dpo_grad.append(g)\n",
    "    v = torch.tensor(v.item(), requires_grad=True)\n",
    "    l = (v - 1.0/(2*beta))**2\n",
    "    g = torch.autograd.grad(l, v)[0].item()\n",
    "    ipo_grad.append(g)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(6,3.5))\n",
    "plt.plot(x, dpo_grad, label='DPO (sigmoid grad)')\n",
    "plt.plot(x, ipo_grad, label='IPO (square grad)')\n",
    "plt.axvline(1/(2*beta), color='gray', ls='--', alpha=0.5, label='IPO target = 1/(2β)')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('logit (β·(h_pi - h_ref))'); plt.ylabel('gradient w.r.t. logit')\n",
    "plt.title('梯度对比: DPO 饱和 vs IPO 不饱和')\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3); plt.legend(); plt.tight_layout(); plt.show()\n",
    "print('💡 IPO 在右侧 (logit 很大时) 依然有 -1 的负梯度, 不会停在过拟合状态.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.2 改进 2: DPO 偏离 SFT 太远 → CPO (+ SFT NLL)\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**: 纯 DPO 可能让模型偏离 SFT 模型太远, 生成质量下降。\n",
    "**改进**: CPO 在 DPO 偏好项上叠加一个 SFT 的 NLL 项 `-α·log p(y_w|x)`, 起到正则作用。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "B = 4\n",
    "chosen_logprob      = torch.tensor([-1.0, -1.2, -0.8, -1.5])\n",
    "rejected_logprob    = torch.tensor([-2.5, -3.0, -2.2, -2.8])\n",
    "ref_chosen_logprob  = torch.tensor([-1.3, -1.4, -1.0, -1.7])\n",
    "ref_rejected_logprob= torch.tensor([-2.4, -2.9, -2.1, -2.7])\n",
    "chosen_mean_logprob = chosen_logprob / 50\n",
    "rejected_mean_logprob= rejected_logprob / 50\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{'alpha':<6} | {'CPO loss':>10} | {'pref_term':>10} | {'sft_term':>10}\")\n",
    "print('-' * 45)\n",
    "for alpha in [0.0, 0.1, 0.5, 1.0]:\n",
    "    pi_logratios = chosen_logprob - rejected_logprob\n",
    "    ref_logratios = ref_chosen_logprob - ref_rejected_logprob\n",
    "    pref = -F.logsigmoid(0.1 * (pi_logratios - ref_logratios)).mean()\n",
    "    sft  = -chosen_mean_logprob.mean()\n",
    "    total = pref + alpha * sft\n",
    "    print(f\"{alpha:<6} | {total.item():>10.4f} | {pref.item():>10.4f} | {(alpha*sft).item():>10.4f}\")\n",
    "print('💡 α 越大, SFT 项权重越高, 模型越不会偏离 SFT baseline, 但偏好对齐变弱.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.3 改进 3: 现实中成对数据难拿 → KTO (非成对)\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**: DPO 需要 `(prompt, chosen, rejected)` 三元组, 但生产中很容易只有\n",
    "`(prompt, response, 用户是否点赞)` 这种**单条 + 标签**数据。\n",
    "\n",
    "**改进**: KTO 用 Kahneman-Tversky 效用函数, 把每条样本独立看 (chosen 用一个权重, rejected 用另一个), 不再成对。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 同样的 chosen/rejected 概率, KTO 把它拆成两条独立样本\n",
    "chosen_logratio = chosen_logprob - ref_chosen_logprob\n",
    "rejected_logratio = rejected_logprob - ref_rejected_logprob\n",
    "beta = 0.1\n",
    "kto_chosen_term = 1 - torch.sigmoid(beta * chosen_logratio)\n",
    "kto_rejected_term = 1 - torch.sigmoid(-beta * rejected_logratio)\n",
    "kto = 0.5 * (kto_chosen_term.mean() + kto_rejected_term.mean())\n",
    "print(f'KTO loss  = {kto.item():.4f}')\n",
    "print(f'  - chosen (desirable) term  = {kto_chosen_term.mean().item():.4f}')\n",
    "print(f'  - rejected (undesirable) term = {kto_rejected_term.mean().item():.4f}')\n",
    "print('💡 chosen 项希望 r > 0 (sigmoid→1), rejected 项希望 r < 0, 各自独立.')
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.4 改进 4: reference model 太占内存 → ORPO / SimPO\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**: DPO 需要同时加载 policy 和 reference 两个模型, 显存/内存直接翻倍。\n",
    "**改进**:\n",
    "  - **ORPO** 用 odds ratio 替代 log ratio, 显式去掉 reference model\n",
    "  - **SimPO** 用 length-normalized log prob 替代 ratio, 也无需 reference"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"=== ORPO: 用 odds ratio, 无 reference ===\")\n",
    "print(\"odds = exp(mean_logp) / (1 - exp(mean_logp))\")\n",
    "print(\"ORPO loss = -log sigmoid(β·logodds(chosen) - β·logodds(rejected)) - 0.1·log p(chosen)\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"=== SimPO: length-norm, 无 reference ===\")\n",
    "print(\"loss = -log sigmoid(β·(mean_logp_w - mean_logp_l) - γ)\")\n",
    "print(\"  - mean_logp = sum_logp / token_count  (天然防长句)\")\n",
    "print(\"  - γ 是正 margin, 拉开 chosen/rejected\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print('💡 内存上 ORPO/SimPO 只需要 1 个模型, 训练成本减半.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.5 改进 5: DPO 忽略 batch 统计信息 → SIPO\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题**: DPO 只看 (chosen, rejected) 一对的 log-ratio, 没有利用 batch 内其它样本的信息。\n",
    "**改进**: SIPO 在 log-ratio 上加一个**batch 级的统计修正项**,\n",
    "捕捉\"当前策略相对 reference 整体偏移了多少\"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# SIPO 核心: 额外加一个 batch 均值的修正\n",
    "chosen_diff = chosen_logprob - ref_chosen_logprob     # (B,)\n",
    "rejected_diff = rejected_logprob - ref_rejected_logprob  # (B,)\n",
    "stat_correction = (chosen_diff.mean() - rejected_diff.mean()).item()\n",
    "print(f\"SIPO 统计修正项 (batch mean of chosen_diff - batch mean of rejected_diff) = {stat_correction:.4f}\")\n",
    "print('💡 这个值反映了\"当前策略相对 ref 的整体偏离\", DPO 完全没用这个信号.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.6 一图总结: 各变体的\"开关\"\n",
    "\n",
    "把所有变体的核心开关画成一个表格, 方便对比记忆。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "data = [\n",
    "    [\"DPO\",  \"✅\",  \"✅\",  \"✗\",   \"sigmoid\"],\n",
    "    [\"IPO\",  \"✅\",  \"✅\",  \"✗\",   \"square\"],\n",
    "    [\"CPO\",  \"✅\",  \"✅\",  \"✅\",   \"sigmoid + NLL\"],\n",
    "    [\"KTO\",  \"✅\",  \"✗\",  \"✗\",   \"Kahneman-Tversky\"],\n",
    "    [\"ORPO\", \"✗\",  \"✅\",  \"✅\",   \"odds ratio + NLL\"],\n",
    "    [\"SimPO\",\"✗\",  \"✅\",  \"✗\",   \"length-norm + margin\"],\n",
    "    [\"SIPO\", \"✅\",  \"✅\",  \"✗\",   \"DPO + stat correction\"],\n",
    "]\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame(data, columns=[\"Variant\", \"need ref model\", \"need pair data\", \"SFT term\", \"loss form\"])\n",
    "print(df.to_string(index=False))\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"📌 记忆口诀:\")\n",
    "print(\"   - 想稳定不训崩 → IPO (square) / SimPO (margin)\")\n",
    "print(\"   - 想省内存       → ORPO / SimPO (no ref)\")\n",
    "print(\"   - 数据只有点赞   → KTO\")\n",
    "print(\"   - 怕偏离 SFT 太远→ CPO (加 NLL)\")\n",
    "print(\"   - 想用 batch 信息 → SIPO\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "✅ 阶段 1 全部完成!\n",
    "\n",
